                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You stand in some type of tube and you have to shoot the red cubes that are closing in.\nIt is possible to smash them with your sword.\nYou have no HUD and no indication what to do for how long. Your vision gets limitated when you are hit.\nSometimes blue objects appear which are power ups.\n\nThe 15 minutes i played this i have the feeling i saw everything. Maybe not true but i wont go back.\nControls are kind of not working all the time e.g. in the start screen you can teleport a little bit to reach stuff easier - did not work all the time.\n\nNo introduction screen what do the buttons on the controller do. Trial and Error. Was annoying while not working all the time.",
